      "html": "<p class=\"provider-bio\">Located in the Fairbourne Station medical building in West Valley City, this clinic brings medical oncology and hematology care to Utah's west side. The fourth-floor clinic offers infusion therapy, laboratory services, and access to UCS patient advocates — making expert cancer care accessible to the communities of West Valley, Kearns, Magna, and Taylorsville.</p>",
